-S \"${srcdir}/llama.cpp\" -B \"${srcdir}/build\" -G Ninja \\\n```\n*   **`cmake`**: The build system tool being invoked.\n*   **`-S \"${srcdir}/llama.cpp\"`**: Specifies the **source directory**. This tells CMake where the original source code is located (download"}